{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":3279,"name":"","username":"bartv","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.n8n.io/bartv/{size}/156374_2.png","created_at":"2020-03-05T20:02:09.678Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThe Jobs category connects people and companies hiring n8n talent with community members looking for opportunities. To keep listings useful and reduce spam, follow these rules when posting a role or applying.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-3279-posting-a-job-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-3279-posting-a-job-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003ePosting a job\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHiring posts only.\u003c/strong\u003e Post here if you are hiring for a role or project. “For hire,” “open to work,” and service-promotion posts are not allowed.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInclude the essentials.\u003c/strong\u003e Every hiring post, including posts by community hosts, must include the role title, a brief description of the work and requirements, the company or project, and relevant location or time-zone details.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProvide a clear way to apply.\u003c/strong\u003e Include \u003cstrong\u003ean email address or application form\u003c/strong\u003e. If neither is available, explicitly invite applicants to contact you by direct/private message (DM/PM).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKeep posts genuine and specific.\u003c/strong\u003e Spam, generic advertisements, and low-effort AI-generated listings are not allowed. Write for the actual role you are offering.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePosts that do not meet these requirements may be rejected or returned for revision.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdetails\u003e\n\u003csummary\u003e\nAbout sending direct messages\u003c/summary\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-3279-how-to-send-a-direct-message-dm-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-3279-how-to-send-a-direct-message-dm-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow to send a direct message (DM)?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eClick the poster’s username or avatar, then \u003cstrong\u003eMessage\u003c/strong\u003e. Mention the role, briefly introduce yourself, and include a relevant work sample or link. If Message is unavailable, check your trust level or use the listing’s other contact option.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-3279-who-can-send-dms-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-3279-who-can-send-dms-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWho can send DMs?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBrand new accounts can’t send direct messages yet - to unlock this, you need to spend some time on the forum, and read some topics. Spending 10-15 minutes should do it.No replies are needed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor more information, See \u003ca href=\"https://community.n8n.io/badges/1/basic\"\u003en8n’s Basic badge\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"https://blog.discourse.org/2018/06/understanding-discourse-trust-levels/\"\u003eDiscourse’s official trust-level guide\u003c/a\u003e, and \u003ca href=\"https://meta.discourse.org/t/trust-level-permissions-reference/224824\"\u003emessaging permissions reference\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-3279-which-contact-method-should-you-use-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-3279-which-contact-method-should-you-use-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhich contact method should you use?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMessage the job poster if the listing invites DMs. Otherwise, use the email address or application form provided.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/details\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThank you for helping keep the Jobs category useful for genuine hiring opportunities.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-10-22T10:20:42.374Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to